Input: {"correlation_id": "ETH-USDT-1h-1789876799999", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1789898400000, "account": {"equity": "10001.906284728375", "available_margin": "9755.3691807283744", "currency": "USDT", "position_mode": "HEDGE", "as_of_ms": 1789898400000}, "position": {"position_id": "wf-main-1", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "side": "SHORT", "quantity": "0.478", "mark_price": "2578.84", "ownership_role": "MAIN", "as_of_ms": 1789898400000}, "positions": [{"position_id": "wf-main-1", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "side": "SHORT", "quantity": "0.478", "mark_price": "2578.84", "ownership_role": "MAIN", "as_of_ms": 1789898400000}], "executor_state": {"as_of_ms": 1789898400000, "controller_id": "brooks-walkforward-10d", "executors": [{"executor_id": "wf-exec-1", "status": "RUNNING", "trading_pair": "ETH-USDT", "controller_id": "brooks-walkforward-10d"}]}, "open_orders": [], "recent_fills": [], "fills_since_last_event": [], "original_trade_intent": {"schema": "brooks.trade-intent.v2", "role": "TRADER", "decision": "ENTER_SHORT", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1789876799999, "market_context": {"location": "2586.68 sits just below the broken 2604.75 tight-range low and ~113 points off the 2700.00 high; next larger references below are the H4 2528.8/2537.57 range top and the H4 higher low 2486.12 (bar 1789718400000).", "primary_regime_and_phase": {"D1_context_current": "bull-trend / breakout-spike; 29-bar range 2357.18-2700.00; second rejected push at 2700.00 (bar 1789776000000, upper tail ~67) after 2680.00 (bar 1789084800000, upper tail ~165)", "H1": "rollover after the failed 2658.79-2700.00 push; H1 bar open_time_ms 1789869600000 (open 2617.83, high 2622.64, low 2571, close 2573.13), then H1 bar open_time_ms 1789873200000 (open 2572.94, high 2594.57, low 2569.8, close 2586.68)", "H4_context_stale_replaced_by_raw_read": "raw H4 bar 1789862400000-1789876799999 is a bear bar (open 2632.98, high 2633.05, low 2569.8, close 2586.68) that closes below the seven-bar H4 tight-range low 2604.75 (H4 bar open 1789776000000, low 2604.75)", "M15": "bear breakout bar index 115 (open 2603.75, high 2606.04, low 2571, close 2573.13) below 2604.75, then a four-bar overlap 2569.8-2594.57 (bars 116-119) with declining highs"}}, "setup": {"type": "bear breakout pullback: short stop below the M15 bear flag 2569.8-2594.57 after the 2604.75 breakdown", "trigger_status": "pending", "signal_quality": "clear", "location_assessment": "favorable", "no_trade_reason": null}, "decision_timeframe": "M15", "context_timeframes_used": ["H1", "M15", "H4", "D1"], "entry_mechanism": "breakout_pullback", "trigger": {"reference": "M15 bar 117 low - bear-flag low, also below M15 bar 115 low 2571", "price_field": "low", "price": "2569.8", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 117, "open_time_ms": 1789874100000, "close_time_ms": 1789874999999}, "kind": "stop", "direction": "below"}, "invalidation": {"reference": "M15 bar 117 high - bear-flag pullback high (equal to M15 bar 116 high 2594.57)", "price_field": "high", "price": "2594.57", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 117, "open_time_ms": 1789874100000, "close_time_ms": 1789874999999}}, "evidence_for": ["M15 bar 115 (open_time_ms 1789872300000, close_time_ms 1789873199999) is a 35.04-point bear bar: open 2603.75, high 2606.04, low 2571, close 2573.13, closing 2.13 above its low and breaking the 2604.75 low of the prior tight range; its M15 volume 917804.613 is the largest of the last 30 M15 bars.", "Raw H4 bar 1789862400000-1789876799999 (open 2632.98, high 2633.05, low 2569.8, close 2586.68) closes below the H4 seven-bar range low 2604.75, ending the H4 higher-low chain 2370.54 -> 2435.71 -> 2486.12 -> 2604.75; the stale H4 analyst context was replaced with this successful raw 120-bar read.", "M15 bars 116-119 overlap only 2569.8-2594.57 with declining highs 2594.57 (bar 116), 2594.57 (bar 117), 2587.03 (bar 118), 2586.69 (bar 119) - a bear flag holding below the broken 2604.75 rather than reclaiming it.", "H1 bar open_time_ms 1789869600000 (open 2617.83, high 2622.64, low 2571, close 2573.13, volume 2568125.853) is the widest H1 range of the drop and closes near its low, and the current D1 context shows the 2700.00 high (bar 1789776000000) rejected with a ~67-point upper tail after the earlier 2680.00 rejection (bar 1789084800000)."], "evidence_against": ["D1 context (current) is bull-trend/breakout-spike with Always-In long and the window's highest close 2632.98 (bar 1789776000000); the short is counter to that, and 2586.68 is only ~59 points below the middle of the large D1 2357.18-2700.00 range, where Brooks expects two-sided trade and weaker follow-through.", "Follow-through on the breakdown was weak: the bar immediately after the breakout bar (M15 bar 116, open 2572.94, high 2594.57, low 2570.27, close 2579.45) closed back up inside the broken range, and the last bar (M15 bar 119, open 2580.72, high 2586.69, low 2579.19, close 2586.68) closed at its high, showing buyers at the breakdown level.", "Failed strong bars are a feature of this window: H4 bar 1789128000000 (open 2457.12, high 2680.00, close 2555.52) gave its entire 235.81-point range back, so the current H4 bear bar may be an overreaction inside a bull leg with the 2486.12/2537.57 zone likely to attract buyers."], "qualitative_confidence": "medium", "uncertainty": ["The trigger is a pending stop at 2569.8; the four-bar flag may extend toward 2594.57 or 2606.04 first, so the order may stay unfilled or be invalidated before a second leg develops.", "The H4 analyst context is stale, so the larger bull-channel versus range-top read rests on raw H4 bars only; whether 2586.68 is a completed higher-timeframe bear bar or a mid-pullback value cannot be settled from closed bars.", "M15 ranges near the flag are tight (about 5-12 points), so the 2569.8 stop sits within normal noise distance of the 2569.8-2594.57 flag and could be probed rather than run by a genuine second leg."], "conditions_that_change_market_read": ["An M15 close back above 2594.57 (bar 117 high), and especially acceptance above 2606.04 (M15 bar 115 high), negates the bear breakout and restores the D1/H4 bull-flag read.", "A bear M15 bar closing below 2569.8 with a range wider than ~25 points confirms the second leg and shifts focus to the H4 2528.8/2537.57 and 2486.12 references.", "An H4/D1 close above 2700.00 reopens the D1 breakout read, while a close below 2486.12 (H4 bar 1789718400000 low) would confirm a larger reversal rather than a pullback."]}, "latest_trader_intent": null, "latest_market_context": null, "management_history": [{"schema": "brooks.management-decision.v2", "role": "POSITION_MANAGER", "decision_time_ms": 1789888500000, "action": "HOLD", "position_ids": ["wf-main-1"], "reason": "The single MAIN short (wf-main-1, ETH-USDT SHORT 0.478, mark 2574.95) is coherent: authoritative ownership_role MAIN matches hedge_state structure_status single_main with hedge_size 0, hedge_ratio 0, unresolved false, margin_health SAFE, executor wf-exec-1 RUNNING, and empty open_orders/recent_fills/fills_since_last_event. The governing policy has strategy_stop_required false, so an empty protective-order set is policy-compliant and the PM cannot place or move a stop. The recorded premise (bear breakout below the 2604.75 H4/M15 range low, short under the 2569.8 bear-flag low) remains challenged but not contradicted: the newest closed M15 bar 1789887600000 (open 2574.05, high 2575.31, low 2572.2, close 2574.95, volume 392624.2) held above the 2569.8 trigger inside the 2569.8-2594.57 flag, 2604.75 is still broken, and the stated invalidation 2594.57 has not been closed above. A tight, non-resolving flag that probes neither the trigger nor the invalidation is not thesis failure and does not mandate reduce, close, or hedge.", "evidence": {"observations": ["Snapshot at 1789888500000: one position wf-main-1, ETH-USDT SHORT 0.478, mark 2574.95, ownership_role MAIN, as_of_ms equal to decision time; positions contains only this leg.", "hedge_state condor.brooks.hedge-state.v1: structure_status single_main, unresolved false, main_position_id wf-main-1, main_side SHORT, main_size 0.478, hedge_side null, hedge_size 0, hedge_ratio 0, net_exposure -1230.82610, net_exposure_usd -1230.82610, gross_exposure_usd 1230.82610, ratio_basis absolute_mark_notional.", "management_policy brooks-pm-v1:brooks-walkforward-10d: strategy_stop_required false; allowed actions CLOSE, HEDGE, HOLD, INCREASE_HEDGE, MANAGEMENT_BLOCKED, RECONCILE_STATE, REDUCE, REDUCE_HEDGE, REMOVE_HEDGE, REQUEST_MARKET_ANALYSIS; protection_semantics states PM decisions are advisory and only the deterministic GM writes to the venue.", "open_orders empty, recent_fills empty, fills_since_last_event empty; margin_health SAFE, equity 10003.77 USDT, available_margin 9757.60 USDT; executor wf-exec-1 RUNNING on ETH-USDT; management_history holds twelve prior HOLD decisions (1789877225993 through 1789887600000).", "M15 closed bars (get_candles, latest close_time 1789888499999): bar 1789872300000 is the bear breakout below 2604.75 (open 2603.75, high 2606.04, low 2571, close 2573.13, volume 917804.6); bars 1789873200000 through 1789886700000 overlap the 2569.8-2594.57 flag with decaying highs (2594.57, 2594.57, 2587.03, 2586.69, 2586.73, 2585.39, 2584.59, 2581.2, 2583.44, 2583.44, 2577.99, 2578.05, 2583.54, 2581.12, 2574.94); the newest bar 1789887600000 (open 2574.05, high 2575.31, low 2572.2, close 2574.95, volume 392624.2) is a small inside body holding above the 2569.8 trigger.", "Original trade intent (brooks.trade-intent.v2, ENTER_SHORT, decision_time_ms 1789876799999) records a pending stop trigger below 2569.8, invalidation on a high above 2594.57, and a bear-flag breakdown premise; the snapshot supplies no entry price/cost basis and no fill documenting the opening of wf-main-1.", "market_analysis is null; no fresh Trader report was supplied at this decision time."], "evidence_for": ["No reconciliation blocker: authoritative ownership_role MAIN matches hedge_state single_main, unresolved false, no orphan or duplicate leg, margin_health SAFE, executor RUNNING, and no open order or fill disagreement to repair.", "Policy compliance: with strategy_stop_required false, empty protective_order_ids/open_orders is not an unmet risk condition; HOLD is an allowed action and the PM cannot place or move a stop, so no forced intervention is available or required.", "The documented premise remains structurally intact on closed M15 bars: 2604.75 is still broken, the 2569.8-2594.57 flag has held for roughly nineteen bars after probing 2569.8 (bar 1789874100000 low 2569.8), the newest bar's low 2572.2 stopped short of the trigger, no close has exceeded 2594.57, and the flag highs are well below the breakout bar's 2606.04 high, consistent with a bear-flag pause rather than a reclaim.", "Risk is small and bounded: gross exposure 1230.83 USD against ~10004 equity, hedge_ratio 0 so no hedge drag, and no fill or order change to reconcile since the prior HOLD decisions."], "evidence_against": ["The premise is genuinely challenged and unresolved: roughly nineteen bars after the breakout have closed back inside the broken range, the mark 2574.95 sits only ~5 points above the 2569.8 trigger, and with no venue-side protection an upward resolution into the 2594.57 invalidation would be absorbed unprotected; the 2570/2570.35 lows are within noise distance of the trigger and could be probed rather than run, so the flag may resolve either way.", "The intent's own contradiction stands: D1 context is bull-trend/breakout-spike with 2700.00 rejected twice and price near the middle of the 2357.18-2700.00 range, where Brooks expects two-sided trade and weaker follow-through; prior strong bars in this window (H4 bar 1789128000000) gave back their whole range, and follow-through after the M15 breakout closed back inside the range (2579.45).", "The snapshot supplies no entry price/cost basis for wf-main-1 and no fills_since_last_event while the intent carried a pending trigger, so the exact fill and current PnL of this exposure cannot be verified, capping confidence below 'low' uncertainty."]}, "risk": {"exposure_before": ["ETH-USDT SHORT 0.478 (wf-main-1), mark 2574.95, gross notional ~1230.83 USD, hedge_ratio 0"], "exposure_after": ["ETH-USDT SHORT 0.478 (wf-main-1) unchanged, mark 2574.95, gross notional ~1230.83 USD, hedge_ratio 0"], "protection_status": "not_applicable", "costs_considered": ["Trading fees apply to any eventual reduce/close of the short; none are incurred by holding.", "Funding on the 0.478 ETH-USDT short accrues while the position remains open.", "No hedge-related cost is considered because hedge_size is 0 and hedge_ratio 0."], "uncertainty": "medium"}, "execution": {"orders": [], "cancel_order_ids": [], "replace_orders": []}, "hedge_plan": null, "market_analysis_request": null, "conditions_that_change_action": ["An M15 close above 2594.57, and especially acceptance above 2606.04, hits the recorded invalidation and would move the decision toward CLOSE or REDUCE under the allowed actions.", "An M15 close below 2569.8 with a range wider than ~25 points confirms the second leg and supports continued HOLD with attention to the H4 2528.8/2537.57 and 2486.12 references.", "Any new fill, open order, quantity change, or partial fill requires RECONCILE_STATE before another action.", "Any change in hedge_state (unresolved true, orphan/duplicate leg, non-zero hedge_size) or a downgrade of margin_health to WARNING/CRITICAL would force re-evaluation toward REDUCE, CLOSE, or RECONCILE_STATE.", "An authoritative entry/cost baseline showing the short was filled materially away from the 2569.8 trigger would materially change the risk read and could warrant REDUCE."], "reduce_fraction": null, "shadow_mode": false}, {"schema": "brooks.management-decision.v2", "role": "POSITION_MANAGER", "decision_time_ms": 1789889400000, "action": "HOLD", "position_ids": ["wf-main-1"], "reason": "The single MAIN short (wf-main-1, ETH-USDT SHORT 0.478, mark 2575.44) is coherent: the authoritative ownership_role MAIN matches hedge_state structure_status single_main with hedge_size 0, hedge_ratio 0, unresolved false, margin_health SAFE, executor wf-exec-1 RUNNING, and empty open_orders/recent_fills/fills_since_last_event. The governing policy has strategy_stop_required false, so an empty protective-order set is policy-compliant and the PM cannot place or move a stop. The recorded premise (bear breakout below the 2604.75 H4/M15 range low, short under the 2569.8 bear-flag low) remains challenged but not contradicted: the newest closed M15 bar 1789888500000 (open 2574.95, high 2575.44, low 2570.79, close 2575.44, volume 543106.7) held above the 2569.8 trigger inside the 2569.8-2594.57 flag and closed at its high, 2604.75 is still broken, and the stated invalidation 2594.57 has not been closed above. A non-resolving flag that probes neither the trigger nor the invalidation is not thesis failure and does not mandate reduce, close, or hedge.", "evidence": {"observations": ["Snapshot at 1789889400000: one position wf-main-1, ETH-USDT SHORT 0.478, mark 2575.44, ownership_role MAIN, as_of_ms equal to decision time; positions contains only this leg.", "hedge_state condor.brooks.hedge-state.v1: structure_status single_main, unresolved false, main_position_id wf-main-1, main_side SHORT, main_size 0.478, hedge_side null, hedge_size 0, hedge_ratio 0, net_exposure -1231.06032, net_exposure_usd -1231.06032, gross_exposure_usd 1231.06032, ratio_basis absolute_mark_notional.", "management_policy brooks-pm-v1:brooks-walkforward-10d: strategy_stop_required false; allowed actions include CLOSE, HEDGE, HOLD, INCREASE_HEDGE, MANAGEMENT_BLOCKED, RECONCILE_STATE, REDUCE, REDUCE_HEDGE, REMOVE_HEDGE, REQUEST_MARKET_ANALYSIS; protection_semantics states PM decisions are advisory and only the deterministic GM writes to the venue.", "open_orders empty, recent_fills empty, fills_since_last